      "content": "okay, i'm really scared of it getting worse, but the relief would be so huge. if i actually do this, can you give me some specific guidance so i don't mess it up? like, how deep should the needle go, and should i try to squeeze it out once the hole is made, or just let it drain on its own? i just want to make sure i'm doing it the \"right\" way to minimize the risk.",
